l tensions rise in the mountains of the Gusu Lan Clan, it is up to the two of them to try and restore the natural order.\n\nThe story of Wei Wuxian's fall from grace continues as more light is shed on his descent into the path of demonic cultivation. The demonic arm only further strains his mischievous spirit. This is the time for him to prove that he has truly broken free from the forbidden path and is not the maniacal sorcerer that everyone remembers him to be."},"tags":[{"name":"Wuxia","rank":94,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Reincarnation","rank":90,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Anti-Hero","rank":87,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cultivation","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Achronological Order","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":85,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Travel","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Skip","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Demons","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Politics","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crime","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Boys' Love","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Zombie","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Torture","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Found Family","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":56,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":46,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rural","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Afterlife","rank":35,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"The Founder of Diabolism 2","english":"The Founder of Diabolism 2","native":"魔道祖师 第二季","romaji":"Modao Zushi 2","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"魔道祖师 羡云篇"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"魔道祖师 第2季"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}